    skos:related <https://ptpge.org/v1/printing/features/colors/spot-color> ;
    skos:scopeNote "PMS umfasst Volltonsonderfarben (Pantone Solid Coated/Uncoated), Skalenfarbensimulationen (Pantone Bridge), Neon- und Metallic-Serien sowie Pastelltöne. Pantone lizenziert das System; Bücher und digitale Referenzen müssen aktuell gehalten werden, um Genauigkeit zu gewährleisten."@de,
        "PMS includes solid spot colors (Pantone Solid Coated/Uncoated), process simulations (Pantone Bridge), neon and metallic series, and pastels. Pantone licenses the system; books and digital references must be kept current to ensure accuracy."@en,
        "PMS में ठोस स्पॉट रंग (Pantone Solid Coated/Uncoated), प्रोसेस अनुकरण (Pantone Bridge), नियॉन और मेटैलिक श्रृंखलाएँ और पेस्टल शामिल। Pantone प्रणाली को लाइसेंस देता है; सटीकता के लिए पुस्तकें और डिजिटल संदर्भ अद्यतन रखने होते हैं।"@hi,
        "PMSにはソリッドスポットカラー（Pantone Solid Coated/Uncoated）、プロセスシミュレーション（Pantone Bridge）、蛍光色および金属色シリーズ、パステルが含まれる。PantoneはPMSをライセンス販売しており、見本帳およびデジタルリファレンスは精度を保つために常に最新版を維持する必要がある。"@ja,
        "PMS inkluderer rene spotfarger (Pantone Solid Coated/Uncoated), prosess-simuleringer (Pantone Bridge), neon- og metalliske serier, og pasteller. Pantone lisensierer systemet; fargebøker og digitale referanser må holdes oppdatert for å sikre nøyaktighet."@nb,
        "O PMS inclui cores especiais sólidas (Pantone Solid Coated/Uncoated), simulações em processo (Pantone Bridge), séries néon e metálicas, e pastéis. A Pantone licencia o sistema; guias e referências digitais devem ser mantidos atualizados para garantir a precisão."@pt ;
